    "answer": {
      "short": "$x(1)=1\\text{ m}$.\n\nDifferentiate, set $|v(t)|=1$, then substitute $t=1$ into $x(t)$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}v(t)&=x'(t)=-\\frac{8}{(t+1)^3}\\\\|v(t)|&=\\frac{8}{(t+1)^3}=1\\quad(t\\geq0)\\\\(t+1)^3&=8\\\\t&=1\\\\x(1)&=\\frac{4}{(1+1)^2}=1\\text{ m}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
